Release Notes i.MX8 Linux BSP:
==============================

BSP-Yocto-FSL-i.MX8-ALPHA1		2018-12-04
==================================================

- Linux NXP Vendor Kernel v4.9.51-imx8qm-phy1 (based on
  NXP tag rel_imx_4.9.51_8qm_beta2)
- U-boot v2017.03.0-imx8qm-phy1
- Yocto 2.2.3 (morty)


Tested Yocto Images:
--------------------
- fsl-image-qt5-validation-imx on:
  * phycore-imx8-1


Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 16.04 64-bit


Features:
---------
- Added support for new machine:
  * phycore-imx8-1

- Added new features:
  * NXP vendor kernel 4.9.51
  * Qt5 (5.8.0) support
  * Wayland support
  * EEPROM support (u-boot-imx/kernel)
  * USB3.0 host support (kernel)
  * USB2.0 OTG support (kernel)
  * eth0 Ethernet 1 GBit (u-boot-imx/kernel)
  * eth1 Ethernet 1 GBit (kernel)
  * eMMC support (u-boot-imx/kernel)
  * SD card support (u-boot-imx/kernel)
  * Support for RTC (kernel)
  * FLEXCAN (kernel)
  * LCD-018 (kernel)
  * PCIe (kernel)

Known Issues/Limitations:
-------------------------
- HDMI does not work (redesign of hardware required)
- Touch does not work (redesign of hardware required)
- Audio does not work
- SATA does not work


Changelog of Release Notes
--------------------------
2018-12-04
  - initial version
